  "body_html": "<h1>IsStrictlyDominant.isWeaklyDominant</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem IsStrictlyDominant.isWeaklyDominant {G : StrategicGame N U} {i : N} {s : G.strategy i} [DecidableEq (G.strategy i)] (h : IsStrictlyDominant G i s) : IsWeaklyDominant G i s</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Strategy</li>\n<li>IsStrictlyDominant</li>\n<li>IsWeaklyDominant</li>\n<li>StrictlyDominates.weakly</li>\n</ul>",
